<title>PHILIPPINES: Basketball-Santa Lucia, Shell win PBA matches.</title>
<headline>Basketball-Santa Lucia, Shell win PBA matches.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of elimination round games on Tuesday in the Philippine Basketball Association third conference which includes American imports:</p>
<p>Santa Lucia Realtors beat Purefoods Cowboys 76-73 (29-37)</p>
<p>Formula Shell beat Ginebra San Miguel 102-92 (48-49)</p>
</text>
